      "decision": "Ordinary delegation and selection-only calls remain the default policy path. Arena owns candidate comparison/synthesis; Swarm owns partition/race/hybrid aggregation. Both use the shared selection reference directly without recursively selecting another workflow. Selected methods inherit the task write, evidence and delivery scope."
    },
    {
