      "section": "Phase C: Aggregate",
      "sources": [
        "pstack-swarm"
      ],
      "decision": "Preserve declared race/coverage semantics and exact revision/measurement evidence. Bounded waves or sequential fallback do not claim unavailable concurrency. Retry evidence omissions once, keep dropouts and unproved slices as gaps, verify winning artifacts and account for every worker and its cleanup."
    },
