      "decision": "Team Up owns the maintained Arena method; Architect runs it through Team Up, and its four principles resolve through Engineering Principles, while preserving caller-specific minimums and proof criteria. Selection uses Team Up policy only; actual candidate/judge models and independence gaps are reported. No external audit workflow is activated."
